{% if executor in ('decision', 'decision_delegate') %}
Executor: Jev, a decision model. It picks one fixed action per step, such as tapping a listed element, opening an app, scrolling, pressing a button, waiting, or finishing. Jev cannot supply free-form text or write answers itself. It ends a subgoal Unfinished when no listed action fits.{{ ' It can hand a step to an LLM via `delegate`; the LLM can type if the tool is available.' if executor == 'decision_delegate' else '' }}
{% elif executor == 'llm' %}
Executor: an LLM that can call any available tool, including typing.
{% else %}
Executor: a custom selector.
{% endif %}
